        <h2>Summary / Description</h2>
        <div class="description">
          Weight gain (grams) of the flight and control groups taken during the preflight, flight and postflight periods.<br/>Some clarifications and/or definitions for the dataset:<br/>A) Excel Sheets<br/>wt=weight on any given day <br/>F1=Flight group dissected on R+0 (day of landing)<br/>F2=Flight group dissected on R+ML (day of landing plus length of mission recovery period)<br/>FC1=Flight Control group dissected on R+0 (day of landing)<br/>FC2=Flight Control group dissected on R+ML (day of landing plus length of mission recovery)<br/>V1=Vivarium group dissected on R+0 (day of landing)<br/>V2=Vivarium group dissected on R+ML (day of landing plus length of mission recovery)<br/>TC1=Transportation Controls dissected on R+0 (day of landing)<br/>TC2=Transportation Controls dissected on R+ML (day of landing plus length of mission recovery)<br/>B) Descriptive Statistics Spreadsheet<br/>LNGB1=Launch nominal group 1b (these are the group of animals that actually were used for the SLS2 experiment)<br/>Count=number of animals used for statistical analysis<br/>Missing=number of animals not used for statistical analysis<br/>Pref gain=Preflight weight gain<br/>Pref gain TC= Preflight weight gain for Transportation Controls<br/>Fltgain TC=weight gain for the Transportation controls during the flight period<br/>Postgain TC=weight gain for the Transportation controls during the postflight period<br/>Wtgain flt= weight gain during the flight period<br/>Postwt1=postflight weight gain during a designated period.
        </div>

